==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

